('33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','10 Tastings of Istanbul Food Tour with a Local Host','10-tastings-of-istanbul-food-tour','Ten local tastings with a foodie host, plus city highlights along the way.','Ready to taste the best food in Istanbul? Satisfy your cravings for local food and culture on this three-hour walk with a foodie host, sampling ten tastings at family-run establishments while hearing the stories behind the chefs, the buildings and the neighbourhood. Departures at 09:00, 13:30 and 18:00.',180,90,'EUR',12,'Sultanahmet Square, by the German Fountain','Food & culinary tour','Easy','https://tematique.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/IMG_1319-550x500.jpeg',true,'tematique','10-tastings-of-istanbul-food-tour-with-a-local-host',ARRAY['Local foodie host','Ten food and drink tastings','Small-group walking tour'],ARRAY['Alcoholic drinks beyond the tastings','Hotel pick-up and drop-off','Gratuities'],true),
('33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','Istanbul Food & Culture Tour: Dinner at a Local Family','istanbul-dinner-at-local-family','Home-cooked Turkish dinner hosted by a local family in their own home.','Experience genuine local hospitality with a Turkish family on this small-group evening tour and munch on home-cooked local treats. Nothing beats home cooking, especially Turkish home cooking, shared around the family table with conversation and tea. Departs at 18:00. Available in English and Spanish.',180,90,'EUR',10,'Meeting point in Sultanahmet, confirmed after booking','Food & culinary tour','Easy','https://tematique.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/IMG_1263-550x500.jpeg',true,'tematique','istanbul-food-and-culture-tour-dinner-at-local-family',ARRAY['English or Spanish-speaking host','Multi-course home-cooked dinner','Turkish tea and soft drinks'],ARRAY['Alcoholic beverages','Transport to the meeting point','Gratuities'],false),
('33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','Taste of Turkey in Two Continents: Europe to Kadıköy','taste-of-turkey-two-continents','Eat your way from European Istanbul to Asian Kadıköy, ferry crossing included.','Taste your way around two continents on this 4.5-hour tour. Enjoy a mix of classic recipes including doner kebab, meatballs, pide flatbreads and the iconic baklava, crossing the Bosphorus by ferry to the lively market streets of Kadıköy and passing city landmarks along the way. Departures at 09:00 and 13:30. Available in English and Spanish.',270,110,'EUR',12,'Karaköy ferry terminal entrance','Food & culinary tour','Moderate','https://tematique.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/IMG_1278-550x500.jpeg',true,'tematique','taste-of-turkey-in-two-continents-from-european-istanbul-to-asian-kadikoy',ARRAY['English or Spanish-speaking foodie guide','Bosphorus ferry crossing','Multiple tastings including baklava'],ARRAY['Alcoholic drinks','Hotel transfers','Gratuities'],false),
('33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','Culinary Istanbul: Local Hotspots & Gourmet Street Foods','culinary-istanbul-street-foods','Specialist food shops, markets and a local tavern with gourmet street food.','Combining visits to specialist food shops and bustling markets with the history of food in Istanbul, this 3.5-hour culinary walk introduces gourmet street foods and a traditional local tavern, and will whet your appetite to keep discovering the city''s restaurants. Departures at 13:30 and 18:00. Available in English and Spanish.',210,100,'EUR',12,'Taksim Square, by the Republic Monument','Food & culinary tour','Moderate','https://tematique.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/IMG_1394-550x500.jpeg',true,'tematique','istanbul-culinary-tour-local-tavern-and-gourmet-street-foods',ARRAY['English or Spanish-speaking guide','Street food and market tastings','Visit to a traditional local tavern'],ARRAY['Additional alcoholic drinks','Transport','Gratuities'],false);